    "details": "<p><strong>Renu Innovation Hackathon 2026:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>Renu Innovation Hackathon 2026 is an innovation-driven hackathon organized by Shri Phanishwar Nath Renu Engineering College, Araria, providing a platform for students, innovators, developers, designers, and problem-solvers to come together and develop innovative solutions to real-world challenges.</p>\n<p>The hackathon encourages participants to think creatively, identify meaningful problems, develop practical solutions, and showcase their technical and entrepreneurial skills.</p>\n<p>Participants will get an opportunity to collaborate with like-minded innovators, build prototypes, present their solutions, and gain valuable experience in innovation and problem-solving.</p>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Date:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To be announced.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Idea/Project Submission Deadline:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To be announced.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Final Shortlisting:</strong></p>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will be selected based on the quality, innovation, feasibility, and potential impact of their submitted ideas.</p>\n<p><strong>Domains:</strong></p>\n<p>Participants can work on innovative solutions addressing real-world problems across technology, society, sustainability, agriculture, healthcare, education, entrepreneurship, and other relevant areas.</p>\n<p><strong>Selection Process:</strong></p>\n<p>Participants will submit their innovative ideas/projects through the prescribed registration and submission process.</p>\n<p>Submitted ideas will be evaluated on the basis of:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation &amp; Originality</li>\n<li>Problem Relevance</li>\n<li>Feasibility &amp; Practical Implementation</li>\n<li>Technical Approach</li>\n<li>Potential Impact</li>\n<li>Scalability &amp; Future Potential</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will be invited to participate in the final hackathon, where they will develop, demonstrate, and present their proposed solutions before the judging panel.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Opportunity to showcase innovative ideas</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience in developing practical solutions</li>\n<li>Mentorship and expert guidance</li>\n<li>Networking with fellow innovators and participants</li>\n<li>Opportunity to develop and demonstrate prototypes</li>\n<li>Recognition for innovative solutions</li>\n<li>Participation and achievement certificates</li>\n<li>Opportunity to compete for exciting prizes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Recognition:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Top Performing Teams:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cash Prizes</li>\n<li>Medals/Trophies</li>\n<li>Certificates</li>\n<li>Recognition for outstanding performance</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Other Selected Participants/Teams:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participation Certificates</li>\n<li>Recognition for their participation</li>\n<li>Networking and learning opportunities</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The hackathon is open to college students who are interested in innovation, technology, entrepreneurship, and problem-solving.</li>\n<li>Students from Engineering, Technology, Computer Science, Management, and other academic disciplines are encouraged to participate.</li>\n<li>Developers, designers, entrepreneurs, researchers, and aspiring innovators with innovative ideas are also encouraged to take part.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Event:</strong> Renu Innovation Hackathon 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Organizer:</strong> Shri Phanishwar Nath Renu Engineering College, Araria</li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Offline</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong> Shri Phanishwar Nath Renu Engineering College, Araria</li>\n<li><strong>Hackathon Date:</strong> To be announced</li>\n<li><strong>Final Teams:</strong> To be announced</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join Renu Innovation Hackathon 2026 and transform your ideas into innovative solutions with real-world impact!</p>",
